---
title: Blog
---
<p>Notes, newest first.</p>
{% if collections.posts.length == 0 %}
<p>No posts yet. A post is a text file in the <code>posts</code> folder named like <code>2026-11-10-my-title.md</code>; copy <code>templates/post.md</code> to start.</p>
{% endif %}
<ul class="card-list">
{% for p in collections.posts %}
  <li><a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.data.title }}</a><span class="when">{{ p.date | niceDate }}</span>{% if p.data.summary %}<span class="summary">{{ p.data.summary }}</span>{% endif %}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
